	quest.0081604AF08D98A2.quest_desc: [
		"The &6large water wheel&r works the same as the regular water wheel but has a few differences, it will spin slower than a &eregular water wheel&r but it can will produce a higher stress capacity before it stops from over stressing. It also doesn't matter if 1 or more sides are covered as it will produce the same amount of stress units"
		""
		"It can also be aesthetically changed to match any plank type you right click on it"
	]
	quest.0081604AF08D98A2.quest_subtitle: "Bigger but slower"
	quest.00A3AD4BD4EE0FC7.quest_desc: [
		"The Guard Tower will employ and house one Guard to protect your colony. Your citizens will appreciate a well guarded colony. A general rule of thumb is two guards for every three citizens."
		""
		"Guards sleep in guard dowers, freeing up the bed they previously occupied in a residence or tavern allowing you to recruit new colonists. "
		""
		"Tip: You can expand your colony border by building and leveling up guard towers."
	]
	quest.00A3AD4BD4EE0FC7.quest_subtitle: "Build a Guard Tower and Hire a Guard"
	quest.0125799CA778E1F4.quest_desc: ["A &6gearbox&r is used to change the direction of rotation"]
	quest.0125799CA778E1F4.quest_subtitle: "You can craft each gearbox into the other one"
	quest.0228747D6C21928F.quest_subtitle: "Make a hoe"
	quest.0228747D6C21928F.title: "Farming away"
	quest.029007D8E8446038.quest_desc: ["The &6train track&r is the thing that the train need to be assembled on and that they run on. They are integral for a train system to work"]
	quest.029007D8E8446038.quest_subtitle: "The key to train travel"
	quest.02EB4EDC6B90650A.quest_subtitle: "The Stock Ticker will allow you to requst items"
	quest.02FDDF872A9667BA.quest_desc: ["The &6chute&r acts similar to a hopper and dropper combined, as you can stack them on top of eachother and they will continue to funnnel the items down and drop them once they reach the end but they can also push items up if there is an &6encased fan&r blowing air up through the &6chute&r"]
	quest.02FDDF872A9667BA.quest_subtitle: "A way to move items"
	quest.02FE61BB85143811.quest_desc: [
		"The &6weighted ejector&r let's you send items through the air. "
		"To select the place that the &6ejector&r will send to, you shift right click the block you want it to land on then you can place the &6ejector&r down where you want the items to be flung from."
		""
		"You can edit the weight of the &6ejector&r, to do that you find an x on the &6ejector&r then hold right click whilst looking at it and then move the scroll wheel that appears to the amount of items that you want to be on the &6ejector&r"
	]
	quest.02FE61BB85143811.quest_subtitle: "Fling Items through the air"
	quest.035D8D1D349F7BC3.title: "Enter an &6Ancient City&r"
	quest.037C1DF06DBC7AE9.quest_desc: ["As always, refer to the &amanual&r for how to construct.&r"]
	quest.037C1DF06DBC7AE9.quest_subtitle: "The &c crusher&r is used for &aore doubling&r, as well as making &dNitrate dust&r from , the 3rd ingredient for &ebiodiesel&r.&r"
	quest.037C1DF06DBC7AE9.title: "The Crushinator"
	quest.038B71E71E3C8213.quest_subtitle: "&eValkyries&r are &eneutral mobs&r who prove themselves through battle. They will not attack unless provoked, and are found only in &8Silver Dungeons&r"
	quest.03C063D04037EEA7.quest_desc: ["Create has a feature built into it called &6Ponder&r, you can hold W on any create item and when the bar fills you will get shown how you can use the item in the world"]
	quest.03C063D04037EEA7.quest_subtitle: "Click the tick to start learning"
	quest.03C2A1DAA831572A.quest_desc: [
		"All &6stack upgrades&r are multiplicative, so having different upgrades in the backpack will increase the stack size."
		""
		"Having 1 of each &6stack upgrade&r will give you 1,024x the stack amount within the backpack"
	]
	quest.03C2A1DAA831572A.quest_subtitle: "x2 Stack Size"
	quest.03E500405A6CA1FB.quest_desc: ["The &6half drawers&r hold half of their respective full sized drawers"]
	quest.03E500405A6CA1FB.quest_subtitle: "What it holds"
	quest.0420DD4A8BB3868F.quest_desc: ["The &6mechanical arm&r can be setup to move items from one spot to another spot like depot to depot"]
	quest.0420DD4A8BB3868F.quest_subtitle: "A helping hand"
	quest.046644A5434F75C6.quest_subtitle: "The &7Invisibility Cloak&r is a common loot item obtained from &aSilver Dungeons&r after defeating the &5Valkyrie Queen&r. When worn, the player wearing the cape will be unseen to &fplayers&r and &fmobs&r"
	quest.046644A5434F75C6.title: "Obtain &3Invisibility Cloak"
	quest.049BDED68524411F.quest_desc: [
		"The &6train observer&r will look at a specific part of the train track and detect when a train is crossing that specific section of track. It will give out a redstone signal when it detects a train going over that piece of track"
		""
		"The &6train observer&r can also only detect when a specific cargo is being held within the train."
	]
	quest.049BDED68524411F.quest_subtitle: "Watches for trains"
	quest.04D70707F44E6366.title: "Locate a &6Deep Dark&r"
	quest.0545C4EC83C4D016.quest_desc: ["The &6iron backpack&r is the upgrade of the basic &ebackpack&r. It has 54 slots and can hold 2 upgrades"]
	quest.0545C4EC83C4D016.quest_subtitle: "Bigger storage on the go"
	quest.05821667594CB9D1.quest_desc: ["&6Andesite casing&r is one of the most used items in the start of create it is used to make a bunch of helpful blocks to make progress"]
	quest.05821667594CB9D1.quest_subtitle: "Right click a stripped log with an &6andesite alloy&r"
	quest.05D344B86D2AD2AA.title: "Build a &dNether Portal&r"
	quest.05DE72DD68A60883.title: "Obtain any log"
	quest.06CD5DEE6AA5CAD2.quest_desc: ["The &61x1 drawer&r holds a total of &632 stacks&r of the dedicated item"]
	quest.06CD5DEE6AA5CAD2.quest_subtitle: "What it holds"
	quest.06F1392B6E3B85A3.title: "Eat &6Golden Gummy Swet"
	quest.085F473094778DCD.quest_desc: [
		"The resource scroll is an easy way to tell what one of your Builder needs. Sneak + right-click on a Builder’s Hut to register the resource scroll to the builder."
		""
		"Now when you right-click while holding the resource scroll, you will see all the needed materials for the Builder’s Hut you clicked on."
	]
	quest.085F473094778DCD.quest_subtitle: "Micromanagement at it's finest"
	quest.094059D7B8F9480F.quest_subtitle: "Mobs attacked with a &eLightning Sword&r will be struck by &bthunder&r, which will create &9Coldfire&r wherever it lands. The lightning that the sword summons will also not hit you, although any fire that the lightning leaves behind will hit you, and if you stand on it long enough, catch you on &cfire&r."
	quest.094059D7B8F9480F.title: "Obtain &3Lightning Sword"
	quest.0A2FEC235F9F58F3.quest_subtitle: "Become a walking furnace"
	quest.0A99C7852725BFC2.quest_subtitle: "&eBronze Dungeons&r have entrances that are located on the sides of normal islands. Bronze dungeons can have a varying number of rooms. Non-boss rooms contain &c&lsentries&r&r which attack the player, and sometimes have chests on 4x4 tables. Some of these chests are &cMimics&r, however. The &9boss&r of this dungeon can't be attacked with a sword. He can, however, take damage from any tool (&apickaxe&r, &ashovel&r, etc.). &c9 blocks&r on the floor of each antechamber aren't minable at all. The &cboss room's&r walls are only minable once the &cboss&r is dead."
	quest.0B009391E3F76D6E.quest_desc: [
		"The fisher is an excellent source of early game food for your citizens. Hopefully you have a decent resource for string. With any luck the fisherman will also get some some extra loot. "
		""
		"If your colony lacks a natural water source like an ocean or river, you can make do with a 6x6x1 area of water. "
	]
	quest.0B06FEF86588FB29.quest_subtitle: "Automatically moves items into and out of the blast furnace"
	quest.0C5DBB7C27A5BE91.quest_subtitle: "Make a cookie"
	quest.0C5F842394B5832E.title: "Collect 3 &dWither Skulls&r and 4 soul sand"
	quest.0D6E099A1A242153.quest_desc: [
		"The &bBuild Tool&r is one of the most important tools in the mod. It's how you will place all building from now on. Right+click any solid item to open the build preview GUI. On the right are controls for moving, rotating, raising, and lowering your building. "
		""
		"Place your &bTown Hall&r block and register your colony. However, the first building to be constructed is the builders hut. Your Town Hall cannot be built until you have a completed builders hut."
		""
		""
		"{image:minecolonies:textures/quests/hc_build_tool.png width:190 height:100 align:1}"
	]
	quest.0E349CAEF1D249B6.quest_subtitle: "&bSliders&r is a boss found in the &eBronze Dungeons&r. "
	quest.0E928868007C2123.quest_subtitle: "Time to Fly! Dont forget you need coal as fuel ."
	quest.0EBB4E5195610A82.quest_desc: [
		"The Sawmill is where the Carpenter will craft any items made of at least 75% wood. This is the point where the colony really starts to feel like it’s running on its own. Be sure to set up important recipes for items your builder regularly needs. While the sawmill starts with a paltry 10 recipes, the number of recipes you can teach the Sawmill doubles per building level."
		""
		"Tip: Be sure to give your carpenter a &ebuild tool&r as some recipes require it. "
	]
	quest.0EBB4E5195610A82.quest_subtitle: "Build a Sawmill"
	quest.0F22EF03C750E879.quest_subtitle: "Has more options compared to the basic"
	quest.0F409DACBEB7BBF8.quest_desc: ["Depending on the pack style you choose, supply ships may need to be placed in water, or in the air. Clear an area large enough to fit your supply ship. This may include digging under water, depending on where you place your ship. The supply ship will not place if there are objects in the way. Right clicking the supply ship on the ground will show a 3D preview of the camp. Using the placement controls arrows, position the ship in your clearing, then click the green checkmark to finalize the placement. If it won’t place, then the terrain is in the way, and you may need to clear the area more. Red lines will appear showing you the areas that need to be cleared."]
	quest.0F51365D30023066.quest_subtitle: "&bNeptune Armor&r allows the player to move at normal speed in water (even if in one-block deep water) when the full set is worn as well as to make full jumps out of one-block deep water. Note that, like all the other gloves, &bNeptune Gloves&r cannot lose durability"
	quest.0F51365D30023066.title: "Obtain &3Neptune Armor Set"
	quest.0FA23DCC58940628.quest_subtitle: "The beginnings of the simplest form of &epower generation&r in this &amod&r. Up to 3 wheels can be joined together.&r"
	quest.0FC223139839BF65.title: "Craft &7Dart Shooters"
	quest.100082345FA03A9B.quest_subtitle: "&cSentry&r are &4hostile mobs&r in &eBronze Dungeons&r"
	quest.107FD0A61301E536.title: "Obtain a &2Sentry Armour Trim&r"
	quest.118D443869E39F1A.quest_desc: ["The &6portable storage interface&r needs 2 to work correctly, one of them on the machine and the other one not attached to the machine and with a 1 block gap and aligned with eachother before the machine is started so that on each rotation is will deposit the excess items into the stationary one"]
	quest.118D443869E39F1A.quest_subtitle: "Move items from farms to storage"
	quest.119DB8BE8676C954.quest_subtitle: "Sacrifice some storage space to hold energy"
	quest.11B587849F60CE12.quest_subtitle: "Backpacks in backpacks. What is this craziness"
	quest.11CBF2CE777F8CDF.quest_desc: [
		"&6Blaze burners&r as used to heat up the basin which is needed to make certain things like &6brass&r"
		""
		"To collect blazes in a &6blaze burner&r you can either right click a blaze with an empty &6blaze burner&r or right click a blaze spawner to collect them"
	]
	quest.11CBF2CE777F8CDF.quest_subtitle: "Used to heat a basin below a mixer"
	quest.11CBF2CE777F8CDF.title: "Blaze Burner"
	quest.120152510AD4B59A.quest_desc: ["While you might think your builder needs glasses sometimes, these goggles won’t help them. The Builders googles are for you. When you put them on your head or in a curio head slot they allow you to preview your buildings at level 5 which is helpful when fitting one building next to another."]
	quest.120152510AD4B59A.quest_subtitle: "It’s A Samsquanch!"
	quest.12BE4EBECF60E611.quest_subtitle: "8x base storage capacity"
	quest.130ACFA7954377AD.quest_subtitle: "&9Valkyrie Armor&r allows the player to fly in mid-air by holding &bspace&r but also additionally grants &afall-damage immunity&r and &aslow fall&r. Note that, like all the other gloves, &9Valkyrie Gloves&r cannot lose durability."
	quest.130ACFA7954377AD.title: "Obtain &7Valkyrie Armor Set"
	quest.130E8FC7479E4271.quest_desc: [
		"The Shepherd’s Hut is where the Shepherd will breed and butcher sheep for food and wool. You will have to capture and bring in two sheep to the Shepherd’s Hut, as the Shepherd will not catch and bring in any sheep."
		""
		"The Shepherd will only keep two sheep alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten sheep in their holding pens."
	]
	quest.1327179C602289EE.title: "Craft &4Altar"
	quest.132AF80A62FFF98D.quest_desc: [
		"Cliches aside, the tavern should be a high priority building in the early game for several reasons. A tavern can house four colonists. Exactly the number that spawned when you created your village. "
		""
		"After completing the tavern, visitors will stop by to hang out in hopes of being recruited into your colony. You can recruit these visitors by giving them the items they request. "
		""
		"You may want to check out their stats before recruiting a visitor because nobody wants to pay too much for a rubbish colonist."
		""
		"&o&8PRO TIP: You can tell a lot about a potential recruit by looking at their boots. Fancy boots, better stats.&r&r"
	]
	quest.132AF80A62FFF98D.title: "You All Meet In a Tavern..."
	quest.133696D3887F1B9D.title: "Enter &5The End&r"
	quest.13D84E8AF1327CF0.quest_subtitle: "Coffee!!!!!"
	quest.13E39EE147F3A618.quest_subtitle: "Make a wodden sword"
	quest.13E39EE147F3A618.title: "Ready for combat"
	quest.13EDB94BAC780438.quest_subtitle: "Collect some sweet berries"
	quest.1461077EB7358B47.quest_subtitle: "Now that we have a working &bench&r, let's shed some &elight&r on a few things.&r"
	quest.14805CAC3DD4BEE8.quest_subtitle: "Have more control over when you are fed"
	quest.14FCB5F442B68F9B.quest_subtitle: "Become a walking blast furnace"
	quest.153C2830E21BD9AE.title: "Shulkers FTW"
	quest.156AA919AC78D534.quest_desc: [
		"&6Elevators&r are a really fun way to travel vertically."
		""
		"&6Mr Beardstone&r has done a video on how to make one, feel free to check it out"
	]
	quest.156AA919AC78D534.quest_subtitle: "Vertical travel"
	quest.157758B7A2C41CF9.quest_subtitle: "A Packager allows you to pack items up"
	quest.15B51FB56A64C303.quest_desc: [
		"Many new buildings and upgrades are locked behind university research so it is worth getting a university built as soon as possible. Researcher will research various upgrades to your colony, and each level unlocks an additional researcher for a total of 5 researchers. Each Researcher can start their own research, but more Researchers does not lower the amount of time each individual research takes."
		""
		"Note: Research time is real-world time spent in-game. However, after level 3, Researchers will sometimes use offline time to work on researches."
	]
	quest.15F03A5E7E14C022.quest_desc: ["The stonemason is another key profession in the colony. They craft items commonly required by the builder. The stonemason will craft 3x3 recipes made entirely out of cobblestone, stone, andesite, diorite, granite, quartz, purpur, nether bricks, prismarine, sandstones, blackstone, and basalt. They can also craft end stone from cobblestone and an ender pearl after you complete the research."]
	quest.15F03A5E7E14C022.quest_subtitle: "Build a Stonemason's Hut"
	quest.1612322BF2AA9ED8.quest_desc: [
		"The &dSoulfire Lamp&r is an item that cools down a 9x9 area around the player. The lamp only activates when the player is in &cdeadly heat in the Nether.&r"
		""
		"It is fueled by &dSoul Sprouts&r that you can grow on &7soulsand/soil&r. It thrives in hot biomes and temperatures, easiest way to grow is to place &c&llava&r by it.&r"
		""
		"The rate of fuel consumption depends on how high the world temperature is above the player's maximum threshold. This can be anywhere from 6 to 18 fuel per minute. Each sprout increasing the lamp's fuel by 4 which means 16 soul sprouts can completely fuel an empty soulspring lamp."
	]
	quest.1612322BF2AA9ED8.quest_subtitle: "Used to mitigate the heat in the &cNether&r.&r"
	quest.1612322BF2AA9ED8.title: "Craft a &3Soulspring Lamp"
	quest.16B6CF5345509CBB.quest_subtitle: "The &bbasic, none automated&r way of making &asteel&r.&r"
	quest.17D3020E559009E3.quest_desc: [
		"When you place the &6water wheel&r you can flow water over it to start producing stress units, it will produce the same stress whether 1 or more sides are covered in water"
		""
		"You can change the aesthetic of the water wheel by right clicking it with a plank and it will appear like that plank type"
	]
	quest.17D3020E559009E3.quest_subtitle: "A method of generation stress"
	quest.17D72340CDE83499.quest_subtitle: "Now you can compress in a 3x3"
	quest.18736449E1AADBCD.quest_desc: ["The &6brass casing&r is the upgrade of the &eandesite casing&r with it's ability to make better quality items for automation"]
	quest.18736449E1AADBCD.quest_subtitle: "The next generation of casing"
	quest.187518D514B536F4.quest_desc: ["The train controls are the block that is needed to allow your train to move once it's assembled. If you put 2 &6train controls&r in a single train then the train will be able to travel in both directions "]
	quest.187518D514B536F4.quest_subtitle: "Make a train move"
	quest.19416F0101F2923C.quest_subtitle: "Left-clicking makes the &cknife&r function like a melee weapon but right-clicking will throw and consume it. Throwing a knife will spawn &elightning&r, which will also spawn &9Coldfire&r."
	quest.19416F0101F2923C.title: "Obtain&3  Lightning Knife"
	quest.194D1CE9DDEFB4D6.quest_subtitle: "When equipped, it will passively &aregenerate health&r at a half-heart every five seconds. The effect does not stack with two stones."
	quest.194D1CE9DDEFB4D6.title: "Obtain &4Regeneration Stone"
	quest.19B1D5DFC3D3D7FC.quest_subtitle: "3x3 Mining! Assembled and upgraded in the engineers workbench."
	quest.19D03831EB5EED02.quest_desc: ["The Blacksmith is a 3x3 crafter and can make any vanilla tools, armor, swords, and shields (no bows or redstone items). You will need to teach the Blacksmith the recipes of the items you want them to create. "]
	quest.19D03831EB5EED02.quest_subtitle: "Build a Blacksmith Hut"
	quest.1AB5695E3FFA5338.title: "Make a &dNetherite Ingot&r"
	quest.1ABAF66FF1313E57.quest_desc: ["The &6hose pulley&r has the ability to pull liquids from the world to be transported, if the source the pulley is pulling from is larger than 10,000 blocks then it classes it as an infinite source of liquid"]
	quest.1ABAF66FF1313E57.quest_subtitle: "Moving Liquid"
	quest.1AC0EC7056C0DCD4.quest_subtitle: "Craft any drawer"
	quest.1AF4019667A352B1.quest_desc: ["The &6trim&r is a really handy utility block within the mod. It is used to link up drawers to eachother when they don't directly touch, it's pretty much a fake drawer as it cannot store any items within it but is still part of your total drawer network"]
	quest.1AF4019667A352B1.quest_subtitle: "Connect drawer without worrying of loosing items into them"
	quest.1AFE8D1CE55C1527.title: "Enter a &dBastion&r"
	quest.1BB571557F74D3A1.quest_desc: ["As you have explored, you may have encountered abandoned colonies. If you like, you can take over an abandoned colony and repair it. This can be a good way to jumpstart your colony. However, if you want the full colony experience, then it’s recommended that you find a good place to settle your colony and start the old fashioned way. Blood, sweat and tears. "]
	quest.1BDAD50E5F4EBC11.quest_subtitle: "You can &c&lcut, break or chop&r items on this &e&lChopping Board&r.&r"
	quest.1BFE0FCD48DD1C61.quest_desc: ["The &6item drain&r has the ability to take liquid out of a container and then it stores it until it it is piped out into a container"]
	quest.1BFE0FCD48DD1C61.quest_subtitle: "Fluid extraction"
	quest.1C16AEE8E29FB5A0.quest_desc: [
		"The rallying banner will summon your Guards to you when used. It’s especially useful in raids, as Guards don’t automatically know where to find the raiders. You must shift + right-click the banner on a Guard tower or Barracks Tower to assigns the Guards in that tower to the rallying banner."
		""
		"Note: Your Guards will not follow you outside the colony border. To bring Guards outside the border, set them to Follow you on the second page of their tower GUI."
	]
	quest.1C8057427F197B6B.quest_subtitle: "&fHoly Swords&r are claimed to do &cincreased damage&r to &cundead enemies&r but they are &cbugged&r in the latest version and do not function properly."
	quest.1C8057427F197B6B.title: "Obtain &eHoly Sword"
	quest.1CCC9AEFE5926066.quest_desc: ["Please refer to the &amanual&r for how to form the machine correctly. It can be found under the '&dHeavy Machinery&r' section.&r"]
	quest.1CCC9AEFE5926066.quest_subtitle: "An automated way to shape &ametal&r into &eplates, rods&r or other &ecomponents&r.&r"
	quest.1CCC9AEFE5926066.title: "Our first &bMultiblock Machine&r - The &aMetal Press&r.&r"
	quest.1E16EC7519387411.quest_subtitle: "Obtained by cutting &a&lTall Grass&r with a &c&lKnife&r.&r"
	quest.1E1870FAD295DEDE.quest_desc: ["Clear out and flatten an area roughly 20x20 blocks to make room for your camp. The camp will not place if there are objects in the way. Right clicking the supply camp on the ground will show a 3D preview of the camp. Using the placement controls arrows, position the camp in your clearing, then click the green checkmark to finalize the placement. If it won’t place, then the terrain is in the way, and you may need to clear the area more. Red lines may appear showing you the areas that need to be cleared."]
	quest.1E41BDDCEF3EA1BC.title: "Time to make some steel"
	quest.1E91F0D9C45968DA.quest_subtitle: "Collect some cocoa beans"
	quest.1EF645986DEE1704.quest_subtitle: "When eaten, it gives the &9Absorption&r and &aRegeneration&r buffs, respectively two minutes and 30 seconds."
	quest.1EF645986DEE1704.title: "Craft &7Healing Stone"
	quest.1F063D68BCDEAE95.quest_subtitle: "Sacrifice some storage space to hold liquids"
	quest.1F08C023EF656B55.quest_subtitle: "Become a walking food smoker"
	quest.1F224ED4009FDB73.quest_subtitle: "Will keep any item in the player inventory as full as possible"
	quest.1F7F129C7C966484.quest_desc: ["In this page is all of the &astructures&r that you can find each &ctrim&r at"]
	quest.1F7F129C7C966484.quest_subtitle: "All the locations"
	quest.1FDCA470EA86BD01.quest_subtitle: "Used to configure some of the more complicated &dmachinery&r we'll be making later.&r"
	quest.1FE273AE15FB9F43.quest_subtitle: "Gives a redstone signal base on the least full slot"
	quest.201CB898A399F1D5.quest_desc: [
		"The Swineherd’s Hut is where the Swineherd will breed and butcher pigs for food. You will have to capture and bring in two pigs to the Swineherd’s Hut, as the Swineherd will not catch and bring in any pigs."
		""
		"The Swineherd will only keep two pigs alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten pigs in their holding pens."
	]
	quest.206159A3C7A78447.quest_subtitle: "Build a Mystical Site"
	quest.20C0B4B05C8F4FC0.quest_desc: [
		"The &6mechanical crafter&r can be made into a multi block to craft different items, the biggest item it will need to craft is the crushing wheels"
		""
		"The largest size and shape of the crushing wheel is shown below with an X the O don't have any &6mechanical crafters&r"
		""
		"&6OXXXO&r"
		"&6XXXXX&r"
		"&6XXXXX&r"
		"&6XXXXX&r"
		"&6OXXXO&r"
	]
	quest.20C0B4B05C8F4FC0.quest_subtitle: "A large crafting table"
	quest.221923EEDAEE1BEE.quest_subtitle: "&eThe Sun Spirit&r is a boss found in the &6Gold Dungeons&r. "
	quest.226171470A06E7E8.quest_subtitle: "Get 4 planks"
	quest.226171470A06E7E8.title: "Craft some planks"
	quest.2263D60876888BCF.quest_subtitle: "&cPig&r and &6Zombie Pigmen&r mobs attacked with a &dPig Slayer&r will take &cincreased damage&r, enough to do &c1-hit kills&r to most &cPig&r and &6Zombie Pigmen&r mobs without armor."
	quest.2263D60876888BCF.title: "Obtain &dPig Slayer"
	quest.228408168636F0BB.title: "Obtain a &6Ward Armour Trim&r"
	quest.22F4C38E79DEFF1E.quest_desc: ["When placing any building, including your supply camp or ship. You will have the option to change your colony style. Click the “Switch Pack” button to open a menu with many styles to choose from. If you want to get an idea of the styles before you build, go to youtube and search \"&eMineColonies Build Styles&r\". Note: This pack includes a number of additional styles not shown in the video."]
	quest.22F4C38E79DEFF1E.quest_subtitle: "TODO: Improve Language"
	quest.23012F6C4C522CEB.quest_desc: ["The Forester is an essential worker in your colony. They will chop down trees and replant a sapling in the tree’s place. Foresters will chop any tree in the immediate area. However, this area can be restricted using a &ezoning tool&r available in the hut block. "]
	quest.230DE6EBD5A1AF65.title: "Obtain &4Vampire Blade"
	quest.2339510EB62BC59A.title: "Eliminate the pesky wandering trader and llamas"
	quest.23BC560BA95B3961.quest_subtitle: "The &eSun Altar&r is a block received after defeating the &eSun Spirit&r, as of the &aAether 1.9 Pre-release&r. The Sun Spirit drops the Sun Altar upon death, as well as the &eGold Key&r. The Sun Altar allows the user to control the time in the &aAether&r, with the &9GUI&r being opened by right-clicking the Sun Altar after placing it. The player can slide a sl..."
	quest.23BC560BA95B3961.title: "Obtain &eSun Altar"
	quest.252245F4C408B9C9.quest_desc: ["&6Brass&r is the start of the next generation of create, it allows for crafting many more advanced options"]
	quest.252245F4C408B9C9.quest_subtitle: "The next era starts"
	quest.252245F4C408B9C9.title: "&6Brass ingots&r"
	quest.2575193E2B12DED1.quest_subtitle: "4x base storage capacity"
	quest.25782DF14CDCCA51.quest_subtitle: "8x Stack Size"
	quest.2707DF325C66A8E6.title: "Obtain a &dRib Armour Trim&r"
	quest.272BF4E885B98841.quest_desc: ["{image:kubejs:item/2025-06-01_17.51.17 width:100 height:100 align:center}"]
	quest.272BF4E885B98841.quest_subtitle: "Here is a look how its done"
	quest.2746EDAC084A2939.title: "Obtain a &2Wild Armour Trim&r"
	quest.2771124207DF211A.quest_desc: ["To make andesite alloy you will need &l&62 andesite&r&r and &l&62 iron or zinc nuggets&r&r"]
	quest.2771124207DF211A.quest_subtitle: "Make andesite alloy"
	quest.2771124207DF211A.title: "Make andesite alloy"
	quest.27B28A53F0EFE604.title: "Enter &dThe Nether&r"
	quest.27D1011D260DE6D7.quest_subtitle: "Be pickier when filling your backpack back up"
	quest.27FE80664E75A40D.quest_desc: ["The &6red seat&r is helpful to have within the train system, especially when it's next to the train control as it will let you put a mob onto the train and the mob will then be able to controll the train's movements"]
	quest.27FE80664E75A40D.quest_subtitle: "A seat to sit on in a train"
	quest.27FE80664E75A40D.title: "Seat"
	quest.2894584EB3C9F40A.quest_subtitle: "Automatically moves items into and out of the smoker"
	quest.28F2A4D414E982F9.quest_subtitle: "Timber! Assembled and upgraded in the engineers workbench."
	quest.2910673D07F5CF42.quest_subtitle: "Items automatically go into your backpack"
	quest.29CAA4C5FF9CE492.quest_desc: ["The &6redstone contact&r is used to dictate where the elevator will stop at when the 2 contacts connect to eachother"]
	quest.29CAA4C5FF9CE492.quest_subtitle: "Part of the elevator"
	quest.29D92477E15FFAE4.quest_subtitle: "Collect a pumpkin"
	quest.2A913D19CDBFCA66.quest_subtitle: "The key to lock and unlock drawers"
	quest.2AA96619167BF9F9.quest_subtitle: "16x base storage capacity"
	quest.2B01B964638DFBD1.quest_desc: ["The Crusher’s Hut is where the Crusher will take items and crush them into other blocks. Most notably cobblestone = gravel, gravel = sand, sand = clay. One important factor to know is that the crusher has a daily limit based on the hut level. Level 1 has a daily max of 16, level 2 has 64. At level 5 it’s daily max is 999. "]
	quest.2B01B964638DFBD1.quest_subtitle: "Build a Crusher's Hut"
	quest.2B2552D2540B0A13.quest_desc: [
		"An efficient way to transport items"
		""
		"You can also use the &6belts&r to tranfer rotation force by connecting them to 2 &6shafts&r at either end of where you want to belt to go along"
		""
		"They do go diagonal but not always at some angles you can tell if it will as there will be rainbow particles showing it can be placed"
	]
	quest.2B2552D2540B0A13.quest_subtitle: "Crafted with 6 dried kelp"
	quest.2B6376258B2E63B4.title: "Locate a &2Trail Ruins"
	quest.2B7C2E8511E4C67E.quest_subtitle: "An XP source from your own backpack, that you filled up beforehand"
	quest.2B9D881B4D3C9142.quest_desc: ["PS you can &eelectrify&r it for bonus damage.&r"]
	quest.2B9D881B4D3C9142.quest_subtitle: "Razor sharp and will damage anyone trying to walk through it.&r"
	quest.2BE227523EDEA77E.title: "Obtain a &dSnout Armour Trim&r"
	quest.2C1E6D3769CEFC50.title: "Obtain a &5Eye Armour Trim&r"
	quest.2C4A4D61C72FA82B.quest_subtitle: "Collect wheat and a seed"
	quest.2CA765EF0BFE18F6.quest_subtitle: "The Stock Link lets you connect networks together"
	quest.2DCA30B19B8F361F.title: "Locate a &2Mansion&r"
	quest.2DCF9C41FA7D28E4.quest_desc: ["The &6train station&r is the part that makes trains work. You can create a train from within gui of the train station. It's other job is as the place where the train will stop along a route, these are the place you enter into the &etrain schedule&r as the stopping locations"]
	quest.2DCF9C41FA7D28E4.quest_subtitle: "Waypoints for trains"
	quest.2DDA061E464CA266.quest_subtitle: "It's like strapping a battery to your back"
	quest.2E232FE3E08A0E7F.quest_desc: ["You can place &6large cogwheels&r at 90 degrees to eachother and it will change the direction of rotation"]
	quest.2E232FE3E08A0E7F.quest_subtitle: "The larger of the cogwheels"
	quest.2ECAEF2599372735.quest_desc: ["&Biodiesel&r is the fuel for both the &agenerator&r and many of &bIE's powered tools&r such as the &emining drill&r.&r"]
	quest.2ECAEF2599372735.quest_subtitle: "The first step towards biodiesel.  Ethanol Produced via the Fermenter"
	quest.2ECAEF2599372735.title: "Up next, the fermenter multiblock"
	quest.2ECEAFAF8FDFF38B.title: "Collect Swift Sneak 3"
	quest.2ED982AECD1576C0.quest_subtitle: "Be a walking DJ booth by playing music disks"
	quest.2FBEFD1AF94468DD.quest_desc: [
		"IE has 3 levels of Electrical Energy. Low, Medium and High voltage, seen as &aLV, MV and HV&r.&r"
		""
		"For now we'll only be worrying about &aLV&r but take the time to familiarize yourself with the power generation section of the &emanual&r.&r"
	]
	quest.2FBEFD1AF94468DD.quest_subtitle: "When attached to a &awater wheel&r or &awindmill&r, it will change &ekinetic energy&r into &aelectric energy&r.&r"
	quest.30B761A4590704DC.quest_subtitle: "Do you really want this?"
	quest.30EC6CB93A81EA78.quest_subtitle: "&eGolden Feather&r does not do anything now but before being disabled, it could be equipped as an accessory and functioned identical to the &bOrb of Arkenzus&r item"
	quest.30EC6CB93A81EA78.title: "Obtain &6Golden Feather"
	quest.315F7691E0BC634D.quest_subtitle: "Does what the name says on the label. In this case we want to produce &eplant oil&r as the 2nd part of &ebiodiesel&r.&r"
	quest.315F7691E0BC634D.title: "The Squeezer"
	quest.3281BDCB53C2399A.quest_subtitle: "16x Stack Size"
	quest.328FEEA1A7803F0B.quest_desc: ["The &6diamond backpack&r is the upgrade of the &egold backpack&r. It has 108 storage slots and can hold 5 upgrades"]
	quest.328FEEA1A7803F0B.quest_subtitle: "Massive storage on the go"
	quest.33058894ACD9CB06.quest_desc: ["The Graveyard is where the Undertaker will bury your deceased citizens. When a citizen dies, a grave will spawn at the location of death. The Undertaker will attempt to recover the grave before it despawns. If successful, the Undertaker will return to the graveyard and attempt to revive the citizen. If the citizen cannot be revived, the Undertaker will bury them in the Graveyard. Another grave will be placed with the citizen’s name on it."]
	quest.33058894ACD9CB06.quest_subtitle: "Build a Graveyard"
	quest.33563F1090D5B5A4.quest_subtitle: "Used to create various &eplates&r, as well as the last step in many &cmultiblock machines&r we will be making with this &amod&r.&r"
	quest.342A1EF584823D2C.quest_desc: ["Okay this achievement is kind of a lie. It might be more analogous to “teach a man to fish”.  Regardless, the point is that if you teach your builder to make simple items that fit in a 2x2 crafting grid (like torches) they can craft the item themselves instead of asking for help."]
	quest.342A1EF584823D2C.title: "Never Craft Again"
	quest.343EA74DC05C15EE.quest_subtitle: "&eSentry Boots&r are currently &cbugged&r and do not function properly at all. They are supposed to give full immunity to &9Zephyr attacks&r (damage and all) as well as grant complete &afall-damage resistance&r."
	quest.343EA74DC05C15EE.title: "Obtain &8Sentry Boots"
	quest.3448B23DF9F63302.quest_desc: [
		"Molt&r can be dropped from &aChameleons&r around once per day. Found in &2jungle&r and &edeserts&r among other similar biomes."
		""
		"Goats&r can be sheared and regrow their wool in about a day. They can be found in &2snowy peaks&r, &2stony peaks&r, and spawn among other similar biomes."
	]
	quest.3448B23DF9F63302.quest_subtitle: "The &c&lSewing Table&r is a crafting station that is used to combine any piece of armor with the temperature-resistant effects of &d&lleather&r, &a&lchameleon molt&r, &6&lhoglin skin/rabbit hide&r, or &b&lgoat fur/wool&r. This allows the armor to provide &dneutral&r, &aadaptive&r, &6heat&r, or &bcold&r mitigation, respectively."
	quest.3448B23DF9F63302.title: "Craft a &cSewing Table"
	quest.34C409E6FF596E2A.quest_desc: [
		"The &6train schedule&r is helpful as you can decide what order a train goes from station to station and how long it is at the station before it departs for the next station."
		""
		"You can right click a mob on a &ered seat&r that is next to the train controls to set that mob as the train conductor and they will follow the train schedule"
	]
	quest.34C409E6FF596E2A.quest_subtitle: "Decide when trains move"
	quest.34CF8CC6400ACAB7.quest_desc: ["When you place a &9windmill bearing&r down you can place a plank on top of it to be able to connect the &bsails&r to"]
	quest.34CF8CC6400ACAB7.quest_subtitle: "An alternative stress source to water"
	quest.34CF8CC6400ACAB7.title: "Windmill Bearing"
	quest.35B96F4A231FE50E.quest_subtitle: "Collect a melon slice"
	quest.36057360ADDD3B23.title: "Obtain a &eDune Armour Trim&r"
	quest.3612EB73B9709015.quest_desc: ["The &6precision mechanism&r is used in making some more advanced items like the &6rotational speed controller&r and it requires a gold sheet to have 3 items deployed onto it in a specific order of small cogwheel then large cogwheel and lastely an iron nugget. That process is repeated 5x and has an 80% chance to work at the end"]
	quest.3612EB73B9709015.quest_subtitle: "Used in some crafting recipes"
	quest.3686BAC07C9F5E22.title: "Make a crafting table"
	quest.37E43341FA234E84.quest_desc: [
		"The Flower Shop is where your Florist will grow flowers for your colony, if given compost and an axe. "
		""
		"One important factor to know is that the flower shop has a daily flower limit based on the hut level. Level 1 has a daily max of 4, level 2 has 8. At level 5 it’s daily max is 20. "
	]
	quest.37E43341FA234E84.quest_subtitle: "Build a Flower Shop"
	quest.38913F2B58E8BAD2.quest_desc: ["The &bcoke oven&r will turn &ewood&r into &echarcoal&r, but more importantly produce &eCreosote oil&r, something we'll need quite a bit of.&r"]
	quest.38913F2B58E8BAD2.quest_subtitle: "Arrange in a &e3x3x3 pattern&r and hit the middle of a side to finish creating the &bCoke Oven&r.&r"
	quest.38B059A326764C85.quest_subtitle: "Automatically changes the tool when looking at a block"
	quest.3972BE6E6685E97E.title: "Crops"
	quest.39AD444F5F568CC9.quest_subtitle: "The key to show or hide quanity on drawers"
	quest.39E6CA577F59AB93.quest_subtitle: "Destroys items when the draw gets full"
	quest.3A1FD20417D15F80.quest_desc: ["&6Super glue&r is the key part of all create multi blocks as it makes sure all the parts stay as one when the machine is started"]
	quest.3A1FD20417D15F80.quest_subtitle: "Getting stuck in"
	quest.3A1FD20417D15F80.title: "Super Glue"
	quest.3A27E71555DD0887.title: "Obtain an &6Elytra&r"
	quest.3B2766CE93DCB42E.quest_subtitle: "Place down &e&lrich soil&r. It will change faster with &d&lsunlight, water&r and an &b&lactivator&r.&r"
	quest.3B40A769EDB26EA2.quest_desc: [
		"Got your eye on a new recruit and need some hay bales? If you place a postbox outside your tavern you can request items from the warehouse and a courier will deliver them to the postbox."
		""
		"Similarly, if you have items you want taken to the warehouse, place them in a Stash and a courier will be along shortly to pick them up."
	]
	quest.3B40A769EDB26EA2.title: "Postbox and Stash"
	quest.3B76AD708C591A48.quest_desc: [
		"The &6mechanical press&r is used for a lot of different things, like making sheets or some recipes using a basin"
		""
		"The &6depot&r is used to hold items on one block"
	]
	quest.3B76AD708C591A48.quest_subtitle: "Helpful for making a lot of things"
	quest.3B76AD708C591A48.title: "Mechanical Press and Depot"
	quest.3B91163DE3DA885C.quest_desc: [
		"Possibly one of the most dangerous jobs, especially early on. The Nether Miner travels to the Nether to mine resources. When the miner travels through the portal, there is a chance they may die. So choose your worker carefully."
		""
		"The portal in the Nether Mine will transport players to the Nether. However, the Nether Miner does not actually travel into the Nether, nor do they actually mine any blocks in the Nether."
	]
	quest.3B91163DE3DA885C.quest_subtitle: "Build a Nether Mine"
	quest.3BE6E50AA8E0170D.quest_subtitle: "&bMimics&r are &4hostile mobs&r in &eBronze Dungeons&r"
	quest.3BF442790F0F281C.quest_desc: [
		"The &6train signal&r helps with keeping trains from going the wrong way as a train won't pass over a &6train signal&r if it is facing the wrong direction."
		"The &6signal&r can be made a 2 way &6signal&r by having one on either side of the track, having a 2 way &6signal&r will make it so a train can pass it if the scheduled station is on the other side"
	]
	quest.3BF442790F0F281C.quest_subtitle: "Help's with train flow"
	quest.3E10D349E202CC89.quest_subtitle: "Aesthetic trapdoor"
	quest.3E666752E4B40376.quest_desc: [
		"The &6contraption control&r is used as the interface of the elevator for the player to look at and scroll up or "
		"down on the mouse to select the level"
	]
	quest.3E666752E4B40376.quest_subtitle: "Part of the elevator"
	quest.3ED77CA15F93C152.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Wrench&r is used to pick up create items really easily, just shift right click a create block to pick it up"
		""
		"It can also rotate blocks by just regular right clicking on a side"
	]
	quest.3ED77CA15F93C152.quest_subtitle: "The most used item in create"
	quest.3F28400EE8FFE9A9.quest_subtitle: "Collect nether wart and soul sand"
	quest.3F85C2E198ACEE74.title: "Upgrading your pickaxe"
	quest.403A0491D1B2C51E.title: "Locate a &2Jungle Pyramid&r"
	quest.4044510266D77027.quest_desc: ["PS these are not &ainsulated cables&r. Approach with &bcaution&r.&r"]
	quest.4044510266D77027.quest_subtitle: "&cWire Connectors&r attach to blocks and act as &ainputs&r or &aoutputs&r for energy. &bRelays&r are used when you need to stretch cable across a bigger distance.&r"
	quest.4099378B803D8CAF.title: "Obtain a &bCoast Armour Trim&r"
	quest.41BC665DC213A3C7.quest_subtitle: "Increase the area in which items come towards you"
	quest.42959B6F1D614D70.quest_desc: ["You can place &6small cogwheels&r next to eachother to keep roational force sideways but the rotations will change from cogwheel to cogwheel"]
	quest.42959B6F1D614D70.quest_subtitle: "The smaller of the cogwheels"
	quest.430475E11D259B74.quest_desc: [
		"The Stone Smeltery is where the Stone Smelter will smelt cobblestone into stone, stone bricks into cracked stone bricks, clay balls into bricks, clay blocks into terracotta, terracotta into glazed terracotta, all types of stone into all types of smooth stone, and logs into charcoal. They can also pop chorus fruits! "
		""
		"Be sure to teach the Stone Smelter recipes needed by your colony. Also, be sure to set a fuel type. "
	]
	quest.430475E11D259B74.quest_subtitle: "Build a Stone Smelter"
	quest.432111807A61E6C6.quest_subtitle: "Keep track of what you want to do"
	quest.43496DF129AA9132.quest_subtitle: "The start of upgrading your storage capabilities"
	quest.4376A8C300C65D62.quest_subtitle: "Allows the player to move up one-block high ledges without &ajumping&r."
	quest.4376A8C300C65D62.title: "Obtain &2Agility Cape"
	quest.442159787F607B8E.quest_desc: [
		"The &6crushing wheel&r is used to start processing raw resources more automatically"
		""
		"Some natural spawning blocks from create can be crushed to get resources the list is:"
		""
		"&cCrimsite&r is crushed to get a 40% chance at raw crushed Iron and a nugget"
		"&bAsurine&r is crushed to get a 30% chance at raw crushed Zinc and a nugget"
		"&aVeridium&r is crushed to get a 80% chance at raw crushed Copper and a nugget"
		"&eOchrum&r is crushed to get a 20% chance at raw crushed Gold and a nugget"
	]
	quest.442159787F607B8E.quest_subtitle: "Crushing stuff"
	quest.4437B6E853A34E0A.quest_subtitle: "Its time for War!!"
	quest.443868FD42BD73C8.quest_desc: ["The &6mechanical speed controller&r is a easier way to speed up rotational speeds, you can right click it and set the speed you want it to spin at"]
	quest.443868FD42BD73C8.quest_subtitle: "Replaces the cog wheel method"
	quest.445816396CD02500.quest_subtitle: "Use a stonecutter without placing one down"
	quest.457F1F059FD8B0CE.quest_desc: [
		"The &6train door&r has 3 modes and each of the modes decide how the door will intereact."
		""
		"The normal mode lets the player interact with the door but it also will auto open and shut depending on whether the machine is moving or not"
		""
		"The manual mode lets the player interact with the door like it's a regular door"
		""
		"The special mode doesn't let the player interact and will only open and close when moving or with a redstone signal (shift + right click will override the special mode)"
	]
	quest.457F1F059FD8B0CE.quest_subtitle: "Fancy door"
	quest.46AB6BCAC2CCE419.quest_subtitle: "Will compress anything that can be in a 2x2 craft"
	quest.47A34C2267D6EB1E.quest_desc: ["The &6harvester&r will automatically harvest crops when added to a machine"]
	quest.47A34C2267D6EB1E.quest_subtitle: "Crop harvesting"
	quest.48573F9B8B326804.title: "Summon and kill &dThe Wither&r"
	quest.48823BBC2A5BD964.quest_desc: ["You can even pack your lunch in it!&r"]
	quest.48823BBC2A5BD964.quest_subtitle: "Stores &aIE tools&r, &ewires&r as well as &cpickaxes, shovels&r etc.&r"
	quest.48AC8545D66B71B7.quest_desc: ["Congratulations! Getting the builder upgraded is an important step. The Builder can only build or upgrade any other hut up to the level of their own hut. So, in order for the Builder to upgrade any building, the Builder’s Hut must be upgraded first. Then the Builder will be able to upgrade any other building(s)."]
	quest.48AC8545D66B71B7.quest_subtitle: "Level Up a Builders Hut"
	quest.490628CE108A833A.quest_desc: [
		"The Courier runs back and forth from the Warehouse to all the worker huts in your colony, delivering materials to workers and putting finished products in the Warehouse. The level of the Courier’s Hut will dictate how many items the Courier can carry and the amount of requests they can keep track of at a time."
		""
		"Courier’s don’t just work on their own. You must build a warehouse, and assign the courier to work at a warehouse. "
		""
		"Note: If you have multiple Warehouses, Couriers will only see the items in the Warehouse they are assigned to. This is helpful in the late game when troubleshooting requests."
	]
	quest.490628CE108A833A.quest_subtitle: "Build a Courier Hut"
	quest.493B9FC17C3CF3CA.quest_desc: [
		"The Rabbit Hutch is where the Rabbit Herder will raise and butcher rabbits. You will have to capture and bring in two rabbits to the Rabbit Hutch, as the Rabbit Herder will not catch and bring in any rabbits."
		""
		" The Rabbit Herder will only keep two rabbits alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten rabbits in their holding pens."
	]
	quest.4945781EFC485651.quest_subtitle: "When consumed, it increases your maximum health by one &cheart&r but will make it appear as if you are being damaged."
	quest.4945781EFC485651.title: "Obtain &4Life Shard"
	quest.49793060345FB28C.quest_desc: [
		"The Cowhand’s Hut is where the Cowhand will milk, breed, and butcher cows for leather. The Cowhand will only keep two cows alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten cows in their holding pens to breed and butcher."
		""
		"Note: &eYou must bring your own cows to the pen.&r"
	]
	quest.49CA52F24C7A62F8.quest_desc: ["You'll probably want a few of these eventually to provide enough &abiofuel&r for various things later on.&r"]
	quest.49CA52F24C7A62F8.quest_subtitle: "Automatic crop growing and harvesting in a very stylish &eCloche&r. Pump water into the bottom, add power to the top and you can pipe items out onto conveyors or create belts automatically.&r"
	quest.4A870C4840BCE3F0.quest_subtitle: "Used to cook meals. Click the arrow to see all &e&lrecipes&r.&r"
	quest.4A95C2FEBBE87637.title: "Meat"
	quest.4A9D0D014C61CB7B.quest_desc: ["The &6sturdy sheets&r mark the start of the train age, you will benefit from having lava and obsidian generating passively at this point if you plan to have an expansive and grand rail line throughout your world"]
	quest.4A9D0D014C61CB7B.quest_subtitle: "The start of the great railways"
	quest.4AD6B33A9AE57386.quest_desc: ["Once again, refer to the &amanual&r for how to construct it.&r"]
	quest.4AD6B33A9AE57386.quest_subtitle: "Finally we can produce &ebiodiesel&r with the 3 ingredients from the previous machines.&r"
	quest.4AD6B33A9AE57386.title: "The refinery"
	quest.4B3D35E2B7562509.quest_subtitle: "2x base storage capacity"
	quest.4B4B3352870D70EC.title: "Collect chorus fruit and flower"
	quest.4B5F93FB8ACD708D.quest_subtitle: "Easy way to drop items into your storage system"
	quest.4BAACD5ACEDCAB1F.quest_subtitle: "Decide more about what's automatically picked up"
	quest.4C076BCACF6E16CA.title: "Defeat the &5Ender Dragon&r"
	quest.4CCDD0283D36BD8A.quest_desc: ["The &6train casing&r is the main block use to create all things train related"]
	quest.4CCDD0283D36BD8A.quest_subtitle: "Almost ready to assemble"
	quest.4CD7F1D6AC64B90F.quest_subtitle: "This &bblueprint&r lets us craft &acomponents&r needed for a few basic &cmachines&r.&r"
	quest.4CFB72C84BA53782.quest_desc: ["The &6millstone&r has the ability to crush many items"]
	quest.4CFB72C84BA53782.quest_subtitle: "Can make dye and other things"
	quest.4CFB72C84BA53782.title: "Millstone"
	quest.4D258CCAC852F5DC.quest_subtitle: "When equipped, it will allow permanent &9breathing&r &bunderwater&r."
	quest.4D258CCAC852F5DC.title: "Obtain &7Iron Bubble"
	quest.4D9DC4973FD340E5.quest_desc: [
		"The Combat Academy is where your Knights in Training will train to become Knight. This also allows them to level up without a risk of dying to mobs."
		"The Knights in Training require a sword and shield to practice. They will attack the practice dummies, a pumpkin on top of a bale of hay."
		""
		"Tip: Consider setting the hiring mode to automatic so new recruits or kids growing up will automatically start training if not already attending school"
	]
	quest.4D9DC4973FD340E5.quest_subtitle: "Build a Combat Academy"
	quest.4DC3AC792B3B91E2.quest_desc: ["The &6mechanical bearing&r is the centre piece of machines, it lets you build any machine onto it and becomes the central spinning part of the machine"]
	quest.4DC3AC792B3B91E2.quest_subtitle: "The key to machines"
	quest.4DC3AC792B3B91E2.title: "Mechanical Bearing"
	quest.4DD7E2BD8508A117.quest_subtitle: "Build one of every herder hut."
	quest.4DE18CB6F344809A.title: "Make a fully powered beacon"
	quest.4EA5BE7A1FC1C75E.title: "Locate a &bShipwreck&r"
	quest.4F2CD9D18AB8D097.quest_desc: [
		"To use them, &a&lright-click&r with it in your hand to pour its water over yourself. This will instantly change the player's body temperature depending on the temperature of the &eWaterskin&r."
		""
		"Alternatively, the player can keep a &eWaterskin&r in their hotbar to allow it to passively diffuse its temperature.&r This method is much slower, but does not consume its water. "
	]
	quest.4F2CD9D18AB8D097.quest_subtitle: "These are best for quick outings. To prep them, they must first be filled with water at any water source, then put into an &bIcebox&r or &cBoiler&r.&r"
	quest.4F2CD9D18AB8D097.title: "Craft a &6Waterskin"
	quest.4F4415CE4EC30024.quest_desc: ["The &6fluid tank&r is a easy way to store a large amount of liquid. The biggest it can be is a 3x3 base and upto 30 tall, which stores a crazy amount"]
	quest.4F4415CE4EC30024.quest_subtitle: "A large liquid container"
	quest.4F603085044BFAAD.title: "Obtain a &2Shaper Armour Trim&r"
	quest.4F6A42D9A9E00F94.quest_subtitle: "A more advanced fluid transporter"
	quest.4FFE92F9BD1FA9F9.quest_desc: ["The &62x2 drawer&r holds &68 stacks&r in each of the option slots"]
	quest.4FFE92F9BD1FA9F9.quest_subtitle: "What it holds"
	quest.5062F049AFCBC5CB.quest_desc: ["You will polish the &drose quartz&r to use in making electron tubes"]
	quest.5062F049AFCBC5CB.quest_subtitle: "Off hand the sand paper and then right click with the &drose quartz&r"
	quest.5062F049AFCBC5CB.title: "&dPolished Rose Quartz&r"
	quest.51E37CE8D0904957.title: "Locate a &2Pillager Outpost&r"
	quest.527C0205FD390DB0.quest_subtitle: "The &aPhoenix Bow&r is found in &6Bronze Dungeon Chests&r. It shoots &cflaming arrows&r (And the text is green) and, unlike the &cVanilla Minecraft's bow&r, this one is not craftable. When you shoot the arrows it will not damage the bow. If the arrow hits the ground, it will be set on &efire&r."
	quest.527C0205FD390DB0.title: "Obtain &4Phoenix Bow"
	quest.53D1F8DFB89185AF.title: "Obtain a &5Spire Armour Trim&r"
	quest.543924673E879C51.quest_subtitle: "Decides what is piped in or out of the backpack"
	quest.54C243CD0E3D8F80.quest_desc: ["&6Andesite funnels&r are used to pull items out of a chest one at a time, they will drop the items onto a &6belt&r or &6depot&r below it"]
	quest.54C243CD0E3D8F80.quest_subtitle: "Crafted with andesite alloy and dried kelp"
	quest.54C243CD0E3D8F80.title: "Andesite Funnel"
	quest.5519761745E81CC5.quest_subtitle: "Become the place that items are attracted to"
	quest.554FC8F643C46697.quest_desc: ["The front of the block will appear &e&llit&r when valid fuel has been given, similar to a furnace; however, the &c&lBoiler&r only drains fuel if it is actively warming up one or more &e&lWaterskins&r, and will stop once they all reach their maximum temperature of &e&l48 °C&r.&r"]
	quest.554FC8F643C46697.quest_subtitle: "The &cBoiler&r is a technical block that is used to heat up &eWaterskins&r (9 Max). It accepts &fCoal, Charcoal, Coal Blocks, Magma Blocks, and Lava&r as fuel.&r"
	quest.554FC8F643C46697.title: "Craft a &4Boiler"
	quest.5562F1C4EAEE40B3.quest_subtitle: "Collect a carrot"
	quest.558BB6BD94C602B3.quest_desc: [
		"The hearth requires shelter (as in a enclosed room) and appropriate fuel, such as coal and lava for cold environments, and snowballs, water, and ice for hot climates. Liquid lava and water can be piped into the side of the block for automation. "
		""
		"Its area-of-effect spreads from the block's location, passing through all non-solid surfaces and filling the room. A solid surface is defined as any face of a block's hitbox that covers the entire 16x16 area. The hearth can affect up to 12,000 blocks within a range of 96 blocks. "
		""
		"Upon placement and fueling, it gradually warms up, providing nearby players with the Insulated effect, reducing the impact of extreme temperatures. This effect maxes out at level 10 and expires once players leave the hearth's radius."
	]
	quest.558BB6BD94C602B3.quest_subtitle: "In a more permanent solution, like a base or outpost, a &c&lhearth&r is a more apt solution to stave off the elements. In the long run, it is much less &2&loperate&r and does not have to be constantly monitored."
	quest.558BB6BD94C602B3.title: "Craft a &7Hearth"
	quest.55C383C939A63F69.quest_subtitle: "Automatically moves items into and out of the furnace"
	quest.55CBF82AD5A2E5B3.quest_subtitle: "Mobs attacked with a &cFlaming Sword&r will catch on &efire&r.Left-clicking while holding a sword will do damage to both &bmobs&r and &9players&r, more so than if by bare hand. Upon damaging a mob or player, &cFlaming Sword's&r durability is decreased by one."
	quest.55CBF82AD5A2E5B3.title: "Obtain &4Flaming Sword"
	quest.565D6552E2594F24.title: "Obtain &7Valkyrie Tools"
	quest.5720A87944651114.quest_subtitle: "The labels glow in the dark"
	quest.57BACA91541F39D0.quest_subtitle: "Gives a redstone signal based on how full the drawer is"
	quest.57C889EC980D33D9.quest_desc: ["I can finally top playing in the dirt (as much) and hand off my farming duties to someone else. I should probably have the farmer start with carrots since they don't need to be cooked, too..."]
	quest.5807DD7C787E6B2C.quest_subtitle: "When right-clicked, it summons two &bCloud Guardians&r who fly beside your head. Every time you right-click, the Guardians will each fire an &9ice ball&r at your target, doing &c2.5 hearts of damage&r per ice ball. The &bCloud Staff&r can be used &a61 times&r before breaking."
	quest.5807DD7C787E6B2C.title: "Obtain &7Cloud Staff"
	quest.583A7AA84FEC027F.quest_desc: [
		"Before anything can be built, you need a Builder. The Builder must build their own Builder’s Hut before building any other huts, and they cannot build or upgrade a hut to a higher level than their own hut level. "
		""
		"The builder is arguably the hardest working citizen in your colony. (Second only to you). You are not limited to just one builder. As your colony grows, you may need to add more builders just to keep up. "
	]
	quest.583A7AA84FEC027F.quest_subtitle: "Say that 10 times real fast! "
	quest.583A7AA84FEC027F.title: "Build the Builder Building"
	quest.58681EC1AFD55115.quest_subtitle: "Use a crafting table without placing one down"
	quest.58D07759E8539B1E.quest_desc: ["The &6gold backpack&r is the upgrade of the &eiron backpack&r. It has 81 storage slots and can hold 3 upgrades"]
	quest.58D07759E8539B1E.quest_subtitle: "Even bigger storage on the go"
	quest.595816F923175174.quest_subtitle: "Destroys excess items that are filtered"
	quest.59AEBA331EE4F644.quest_desc: ["The &6steam engine&r is a way to produce stress units using heat and water. When placing a &6steam engine&r on the side of a &efluid tank&r that's full of water and has a heat source below it it will start to create rotational force. The higher the heat source the faster the &6steam engine&r will move. The best source for the highest output is &eblaze burners&r being fed blaze cakes to super heat the water tank. At the highest level you can add 8 &6steam engines&r to the tank."]
	quest.59AEBA331EE4F644.quest_subtitle: "A different stress unit source"
	quest.5A11A2FC20E5CE2A.quest_desc: [
		"The Barracks is the ultimate protection for your colony. The Barracks Towers (unlike the normal Guard tower) will employ and house one Guard for every level built, for a total of 5 Guards per Barracks Tower!"
		""
		"In the later game you will likely want two barracks chock full of &mexpendable&r brave souls."
		""
		"Tip: At level 3, you can hire spies for 5 gold per raid, these spies will go out into the world and if barbarians are spotted, the spies will tell you exactly where the barbarians are."
	]
	quest.5A11A2FC20E5CE2A.quest_subtitle: "Build a Barracks"
	quest.5A429A325A091857.quest_subtitle: "It cannot be crafted with &cObsidian&r, and must be crafted from &ePhoenix Armor&r and &bIcestone&r."
	quest.5A429A325A091857.title: "Obtain &8Obsidian Armor Set"
	quest.5A44507202DFA541.quest_subtitle: "You will need 3 hulls to build your first plane"
	quest.5A60751EB3771E5A.quest_desc: [
		"There is no external wiki for this mod, and so we must rely on the in game &amanual&r. Fortunately for us, a lot of time has been spent on this &amanual&r and it will serve you well.&r"
		""
		"Oh yes, you'll need plenty of space for this mod.  Plan to end up with a big factory :)"
	]
	quest.5A60751EB3771E5A.quest_subtitle: "&cRailguns&r, &bTesla Coils&r, &eRevolvers&r, &dElectrified fences&r, &aAutomated turrets&r. All this and more awaits us with &eImmersive Engineering&r. We begin our journey by crafting the wonderfully detailed &aEngineer's Manual&r.&r"
	quest.5A6F1FC24EEEBF1B.quest_subtitle: "&6Phoenix Armor&r grants full resistance to both &clava&r and &cfire&r when worn."
	quest.5A6F1FC24EEEBF1B.title: "Obtain &6Phoenix Armor Set"
	quest.5A7B1CB5FB1E7D0C.quest_subtitle: "Make a shovel"
	quest.5A7B1CB5FB1E7D0C.title: "The dirt destroyer"
	quest.5B47CA991C15A9AE.quest_subtitle: "&dIndustrial hemp seeds&r can be found by breaking &egras&r, and the &efiber&r they produce can be used in various recipes, including making &estring&r.&r"
	quest.5B98BE53368EEFB5.title: "Craft &dGravitite Armor Set"
	quest.5BE1B13E934BBA98.quest_subtitle: "Used as well as tank upgrade to move liquids"
	quest.5C1E3564EC1DA17A.title: "Obtain a &6Silence Armour Trim&r"
	quest.5C726D0A9F70EC89.title: "Obtain a &2Wayfinder Armour Trim&r"
	quest.5D23961C159EA3B6.title: "Obtain a &bTide Armour Trim&r"
	quest.5D84A485688322A2.quest_desc: ["The &62x1 drawer&r holds &616 stacks&r in each of the option slots"]
	quest.5D84A485688322A2.quest_subtitle: "What it holds"
	quest.5DAAA9A6884C1BD1.title: "Craft &dGravitite Tools"
	quest.5DE1DAE7AECE29FF.title: "Locate an &5End City&r"
	quest.5DF5D88625C2AC31.quest_subtitle: "&c&lCooking on the go&r. Hold near a &e&lheatsource&r and hold food in your &e&loffhand&r then right click the &6&lSkillet&r.&r"
	quest.5E1A35C47F347B0C.quest_subtitle: "Collect beetroot and a beetroot seed"
	quest.5E896C43C43C9328.quest_subtitle: "&9Valkyrie Lances&r have extended reach, so their melee range is &a10 blocks&r. This makes it technically a quasi-ranged weapon, due to its long reach.Left-clicking while holding a sword will do damage to both &bmobs&r and &9players&r, more so than if by bare hand. Upon damaging a mob or player, &9Valkyrie Lance's&r durability is decreased by one."
	quest.5E896C43C43C9328.title: "Obtain &7Valkyrie Lance"
	quest.5EED0418B36B0542.quest_subtitle: "Smelted Gravitite Ore. The ore falls up and is found at the bottom of Aether Islands."
	quest.5F1C371B9CF45003.quest_subtitle: "Fill up your backpack from your storage"
	quest.5F8F8BB3BF640A17.title: "Locate a &eDesert Pyramid&r"
	quest.5FC01763770A062E.quest_desc: [
		"The Town Hall is the central building in your colony. It provides lots of helpful information about your colony such as citizen stats, open work orders, citizen happiness, allies and more. "
		""
		"The settings tab should be a first stop for any new colonist as it contains options for hiring mode, housing assignment mode, and options to allow kids to be born. Also, this is where you can customize your colony flag. Your flag will appear on guard towers and guard shields. "
	]
	quest.5FC01763770A062E.title: "Town Hall"
	quest.5FD35A49782B2E04.quest_subtitle: "Its a test run so only 20 slots on the server at a time"
	quest.607FE56A60D6233E.quest_subtitle: "Save hotbar slots, only have the tool for the job out. Left click the block to tell it what you want to interact with"
	quest.608A74EE3C04347E.quest_desc: ["The &6spout&r can be used to drop liquid onto an item that's below it on a depot or belt to be able to change what the item is"]
	quest.608A74EE3C04347E.quest_subtitle: "Liquid used in crafting?"
	quest.609FC1AA946FCE5A.quest_subtitle: "Make an axe"
	quest.609FC1AA946FCE5A.title: "Becoming a lumberjack"
	quest.60AA10434B10BE89.quest_subtitle: "Laid out in a &e2x2x2 pattern&r then hit on a side with a &bhammer&r. The &cAlloy kiln&r will make advanced materials such as &aelectrum&r and &aConstantan&r.&r"
	quest.61B3B50BE9D0A6E5.quest_subtitle: "Reduces the total stack size to 1 stack "
	quest.61CD3569BD40174D.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.61CD3569BD40174D.quest_subtitle: "item vaults is the main item you need to get started"
	quest.61CD3569BD40174D.title: "First you need item vaults"
	quest.61E93451B17E83FA.quest_subtitle: "Booker! Catch!"
	quest.62DE24AD061AC90F.title: "Visit a &dNether Fortress&r"
	quest.6358A145E9CDFDDA.quest_desc: [
		"The &6draw controller&r is the main item you will want to use to automatically put your items into drawers that are linked to the controller."
		""
		"It has a range of 12 blocks from each side, a &625x25x25&r cube with the controller as the middle block."
	]
	quest.6358A145E9CDFDDA.quest_subtitle: "The brains of storage drawers"
	quest.637518C8B16B8814.quest_desc: ["It can fire multiple types of ammo so be sure to check the &amanual&r for the list.&r"]
	quest.637518C8B16B8814.quest_subtitle: "It fires stuff.. &creally really fast&r.&r"
	quest.647F95EED59927B7.quest_desc: [
		"Starving colonists will eat just about anything, including raw food and rotten flesh. Yuck! "
		""
		"When citizens are hungry, they will come to the Restaurant and the Cook will give them food. (assuming you have food to give them) Consider building a Fisher’s Hut, or a Cowhand’s Hut. "
		""
		"Note: Make sure to choose a fuel for your cook to use. Some popular options are charcoal, sticks, and planks, although anything with a burn time will work. "
	]
	quest.6553CDC45C522E7F.quest_desc: [
		"The &6mixer&r has many different recipes that it can be used for."
		""
		"One of the recipes is it can make &6andesite alloy&r in a more efficient manner only costing 1 andesite and 1 iron/zinc nugget"
	]
	quest.6553CDC45C522E7F.quest_subtitle: "It's got a lot of uses"
	quest.6553CDC45C522E7F.title: "Mechanical Mixer and Basin"
	quest.657FE1419444750E.title: "Locate &5The Stronghold&r"
	quest.65D23E7683812E26.quest_desc: [
		"What kind of a leader are you?! Your citizens are so hungry, they are eating rotten flesh! &eAre you eating rotten flesh?&r Can you spare some bread or apples for the colony? "
		""
		"It is strongly suggested that you build a restaurant and any of the 5 herding huts or a fisher’s hut. If you have those buildings already, check that buildings have the resources they need to work."
	]
	quest.65FD004534739EC2.quest_subtitle: "The backpack will last forever"
	quest.678899CDF7301857.quest_subtitle: "We'll be needing some &ewires&r for our first powered machines soon enough.&r"
	quest.67E8B8DCFC93F832.quest_desc: ["The warehouse is completed. It might not seem like much, but you can't have much of a trade empire without a place to store things. "]
	quest.683A92E55D973B4A.quest_subtitle: "Collect a potato"
	quest.689AA5A7C33719D2.quest_subtitle: "Collect a kelp"
	quest.68AA8AA92432E22E.title: "Obtain a &2Raiser Armour Trim&r"
	quest.68BF5A98532CD5C3.quest_subtitle: "&6The Valkyrie Queen&r is a boss found in the &8Silver Dungeon&r. "
	quest.68FC81E133443E76.quest_desc: [
		"The Library is a way for you to raise your adult citizens’ Intelligence skill, which influences skill increases once employed. A citizen will randomly level up their Intelligence as long as they’re assigned to the Library. Paper and books help Library Students increase their skills faster."
		""
		"Being a Library Student is a full-time job, and a student cannot be employed simultaneously at any other hut."
		""
		"Tip: Consider setting the hiring mode to automatic so new recruits or kids growing up will start school automatically."
	]
	quest.68FC81E133443E76.quest_subtitle: "Build a Library"
	quest.695A48FD1A51C09E.title: "Kill the &6Warden&r"
	quest.69849D6D7925AC16.title: "Craft &5Zanite Tools"
	quest.69EAF1072D492F1A.quest_desc: [
		"The Ancient Tome is a glowing book that’s dropped by raiders during raids. If you have the Ancient Tome in your inventory, it will glow when there is going to be a raid that night. "
		""
		"In the later game, the Enchanter can convert Ancient Tomes into enchanted books. "
	]
	quest.69EAF1072D492F1A.quest_subtitle: "Keep one in your hotbar"
	quest.6A60B76053393288.quest_desc: ["The Smeltery is where the Smelter will smelt ores into ingots. The higher the level of the Smeltery, the more furnaces the Smelter will be able to use. A higher level will also have a higher chance to double and even triple the ingot output per block of ore."]
	quest.6A60B76053393288.quest_subtitle: "Builder a Smelter"
	quest.6B093C1DD6F02BCE.quest_desc: ["The &6upgrade base&r is the main thing needed for each upgrade that you can use within the mod, it is used to craft every single upgrade"]
	quest.6B093C1DD6F02BCE.quest_subtitle: "The key to maximising the backpack"
	quest.6B0CE8AD86991E28.quest_desc: [
		"The Composter’s Hut is where the Composter will turn organic materials into compost, which can be used by the Farmer or Florist to fertilize crops or flowers. "
		""
		"Note: You must configure the composter’s hut with the items you want composted before the composter will compost. &7&oThis sounds similar to a woodchuck tongue twister.&r"
	]
	quest.6B0CE8AD86991E28.quest_subtitle: "Build a Composter Hut"
	quest.6B3FCFFD367945DB.quest_subtitle: "Adds a bar on the drawer to show how full it is"
	quest.6B894F0707B3E19A.quest_subtitle: "The key to show or hide labels"
	quest.6BB0C51EE8CA5966.quest_desc: [
		"At the Mine, the Miner will mine for ores and materials. Once they are hired, the Miner will first create a shaft downward to a specific depth depending on the level of the Mine. Once the main shaft is completed, the Miner will then branch out. While mining, sometimes the Miner will get lucky and get an ore block instead of a basic stone block. &7&o(magic!)&r&r"
		""
		"Tip: The miner fills holes and gaps with a Fill Block, cobblestone by default. However, the fill block can be changed in the Miner’s Hut settings. If you have a forester and lots of wood, consider using wood planks. Or perhaps now you will have a use for all that deepslate."
	]
	quest.6BB0C51EE8CA5966.quest_subtitle: "Build a Mine"
	quest.6D223FBC4FAD5E21.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Copper backpack&r is an option if you are running low on iron as a mid point between standard and iron."
		""
		"It uses 8 copper to craft with the standard backpack"
		""
		"To upgraed it to iron costs 4 iron instead of the 8 it costs to go from standard to iron"
	]
	quest.6D223FBC4FAD5E21.quest_subtitle: "Optional Quest"
	quest.6D56AD1BEC644A10.quest_desc: [
		"The Archery is where your Archers in Training will train to become Archer. This also allows them to level up without a risk of dying to mobs. "
		""
		"The Archers in Training require a bow to practice. They will shoot at the practice targets, a target block"
		""
		"Tip: Consider setting the hiring mode to automatic so new recruits or kids growing up will automatically start training if not already attending school. "
	]
	quest.6D56AD1BEC644A10.quest_subtitle: "Build an Archery"
	quest.6D8322083F35B581.quest_desc: ["The &6pipe&r and &6mechanical pump&r are used hand in hand to move liquids around, the &6pump&r does need to be given so rotational speed, depending on the way the rotation goes decideds which way by default the &6pump&r wants to move the liquid, the wrench can be used on it to switch the way the liquid is moved by the pump"]
	quest.6D8322083F35B581.quest_subtitle: "Moving liquid in pipes"
	quest.6E1DCAFE1A9CE229.quest_desc: ["&6Shafts&r are way to transfer a rotation in a straight line either vertical or horizontal"]
	quest.6E1DCAFE1A9CE229.quest_subtitle: "Crafted with 2 andesite alloy"
	quest.6E1DCAFE1A9CE229.title: "Make a shaft"
	quest.6E22899E3C214F4E.quest_subtitle: "Oh you want a fancy plane?"
	quest.6E3AB2D23BF7F1BA.quest_subtitle: "Not much to be said here, it's used to make&c treated wood&r.&r"
	quest.6EBB0DBB354AFBB1.quest_subtitle: "The &bFreezer&r allowed you to place certain items such as &erings&r and &ependants&r and then freeze them into &6ice versions&r of the item."
	quest.6EBB0DBB354AFBB1.title: "Craft &7Freezer"
	quest.6EEA012FA11C7C08.quest_desc: ["Once you have found the location for your colony, you will likely want to build either a supply camp or supply ship. You can choose one but not both. Either will provide you with some basic supplies to help you get started in the early game. &o&7(bed, food, basic tools and armor, starting resources, etc.)&r&r It’s beneficial to place your supply camp or ship near your colony as you will be traveling back and forth to it frequently in the early game. &eClose, but not in the way close.&r"]
	quest.6FDAC276AFE8C11C.quest_desc: [
		"To speed up cogwheels you can place a &dlarge cogwheel&r adjacent to a &6small cogwheel&r"
		""
		"Then place a &dlarge cogwheel&r on the face of a &6small cogwheel&r"
		""
		"Then repeat the process as much as you can with the stress units you have available"
	]
	quest.6FDAC276AFE8C11C.quest_subtitle: " "
	quest.6FE386C83D27FF6F.quest_subtitle: "Make a wooden pickaxe"
	quest.6FE386C83D27FF6F.title: "Start your mining adventures"
	quest.6FF933A5EB730FBA.title: "Upgrade your pickaxe"
	quest.702202BCA0E47E11.quest_subtitle: "A &6Book of Lore&r could be read by right-clicking with the book in hand, and then players would view an open book stating the volume and the world the volume refers to. Underneath the title, there would be a slot where players can place any item native to that world. Once placed in the slot, the book would display information about the item. Each &6Book of Lore&r would only display information about their native items"
	quest.702202BCA0E47E11.title: "Craft &3Book of Lore"
	quest.70A75283C9644151.quest_subtitle: "Oh you want to make sushi"
	quest.7130241E0EDD4C47.quest_subtitle: "Created in the &bcoke oven&r from &fCoal&r, this is the only fuel usable in some of the &dmultiblocks&r we have coming up.&r"
	quest.7149B8FB49671630.quest_subtitle: "&6Gold Dungeons&r are located within spherical islands with lots of &eGolden Oak&r trees growing on top of them. This dungeon normally will only have the &c&lboss room&r&r in it, with no treasure/mob rooms beforehand. The &eSun Spirit&r cannot be killed by attacking it directly and must be killed by hitting the &fwhite object&r he throws back at it multiple times. Every time it is hit with the white object, it sends out a smaller version of itself to attack the player. Once the player kills the &eSun Spirit&r, the sun will finally set in the Aether. Before the player kills the Sun Spirit, the sun will never go down. If the player fails to kill the &eSun Spirit&r, their spawnpoint will be reset over &clava&r, forcing the player to delete the map."
	quest.7188323C420A607C.title: "Eat &3Blue Gummy Swet"
	quest.71FB9546B1E7FF13.quest_desc: [
		"The &6mechanical saw&r lets you chop down a whole tree with only destroying one of the logs using the saw."
		""
		"It can also be used to process different wooden resources, just make sure that the saw is moving in the same direction as the items are flowing"
	]
	quest.71FB9546B1E7FF13.quest_subtitle: "Advanced Lumberjacking"
	quest.71FB9546B1E7FF13.title: "Mechanical Saw"
	quest.71FCF06A98CC66D7.quest_desc: [
		"With so many colonists working for the greater good it can be difficult to know who needs what. The clipboard is an easy way to see all the requests your workers have."
		""
		"&eSneak + right-click&r on your town hall block to register the clipboard."
	]
	quest.726B1D91D9DFC698.quest_subtitle: "Gives a redstone signal based on most full slot"
	quest.72B3D4B0A4CE6E74.quest_subtitle: "Treated wood is used in quite a few recipes and you'll be making a fair bit of it.&r"
	quest.72C749AD9F1C634E.quest_desc: [
		"Citizens will go to the Residence they are assigned to at night to sleep. The Residence is also a way to get more citizens for your colony. Every residence level adds another bed. More beds means more citizen capacity."
		""
		"It’s worth considering residence locations and the citizens they house. Workers get grumpy when they have to travel long distances to work. Try to move citizens into homes close to where they work. "
	]
	quest.72C749AD9F1C634E.quest_subtitle: "Build a Residence"
	quest.72CFA89AAD7EC0A6.title: "Explore the outer end"
	quest.72F28B55472BDA33.quest_subtitle: "&bSnip Snip!&r Used to create &ewires&r, at least until we can automate it.&r"
	quest.73154E99297677A1.quest_subtitle: "Used on &e&lCutting Board&r to cut crops etc or tall grass. Also guarantees a secondary drop from animals.&r"
	quest.73DF572B19475A77.quest_subtitle: "The basics parts needed to get items moving automatically. Don't forget to check &aJEI&r for some of the other cool &econveyor blocks&r.&r"
	quest.74C114D0C0D4D374.quest_desc: ["Remember in the beginning how it seemed that everyone was sick with Influenza and you had to keep feeding everyone carrots and potatoes? With the hospital built, they can go see the doctor and get cured by the Healer. You or the colony still needs to supply the ingredients."]
	quest.74C114D0C0D4D374.quest_subtitle: "Build a Hospital"
	quest.74CD7840FADDE7EE.quest_desc: ["Further along the line we can automate the table"]
	quest.74CD7840FADDE7EE.quest_subtitle: "The &aengineer's workbench&r provides a discount when used to create various components. Multiple &bblueprints&r can be used on the table to set its type.&r"
	quest.75599A9909C7A8C8.quest_desc: ["Citizens need to eat in order to work. Until you have a restaurant and a steady supply of food, you will need to put a few pieces of food in their inventory. They’ll eat when they are hungry."]
	quest.75599A9909C7A8C8.title: "Another Mouth to Feed"
	quest.75619B23BB13A8D7.quest_desc: ["The &6deployer&r is the start of automation as it is used in many different multi step crafts like &6precision mechanisms&r and many others"]
	quest.75619B23BB13A8D7.quest_subtitle: "Start of automation"
	quest.7569BB5427BCA43F.quest_desc: [
		"Connecting &bsails&r to a plank or any block ontop of the &9windmill bearing&r will generate more stress"
		""
		"You can place them in any shape you like"
	]
	quest.7569BB5427BCA43F.quest_subtitle: "More sails = quicker windmill = more stress created"
	quest.756FE34BBC2FB534.quest_subtitle: "Collect an apple"
	quest.75CE07C113E20D96.title: "Craft &5Zanite Armor Set"
	quest.763EC1241C4E9EFA.quest_subtitle: "Can decide which slot on hotbar is refilled and can pick block items in the backpack"
	quest.768BD439E3A8384E.quest_desc: ["When supplied with valid fuel, the &bIcebox&r will emit particles and show icicles forming on its sides. The Icebox only drains fuel if it is actively cooling down one or more &eWaterskins&r, and will stop once they all reach their minimum temperature of &e21 °C&r.&r"]
	quest.768BD439E3A8384E.quest_subtitle: "The &bIcebox&r is a technical block that is used to cool down &eWaterskins&r (9 Max). It accepts &fSnowballs, Snow, Water, Ice, and Packed Ice&r as fuel.&r"
	quest.768BD439E3A8384E.title: "Craft a &bIcebox"
	quest.768F721251C3B072.title: "Obtain a &2Vex Armour Trim&r"
	quest.76B45C5766C61369.quest_desc: ["The &6Goggles&r are really helpful to be able to see how much stress units (SU) machines are using or producing, it's really nice to be able to see why you machines have stopped"]
	quest.76B45C5766C61369.quest_subtitle: "See extra information"
	quest.76BD35864351DC4C.quest_subtitle: "Collect some glow berries"
	quest.76D185BEC0C37EC0.quest_subtitle: "32x base storage capacity"
	quest.7708A18574BE8749.title: "Craft &eQuicksoil Glass"
	quest.77814DAB91725098.title: "Locate a &bMonument&r"
	quest.7796359B0F6A6606.quest_desc: ["The basic &6backpack&r has 27 storage slots and can hold 1 upgrade"]
	quest.7796359B0F6A6606.quest_subtitle: "A nice way to store items on the go"
	quest.77FB064296CB5CE8.quest_subtitle: "Be more decicive in what is voided and how"
	quest.780A844B70CC6CC1.quest_subtitle: "Only want to smelt a few items and not use a full coal try this "
	quest.7870800C28A7E199.quest_desc: [
		"The Chicken Farmer’s Hut is where the Chicken Farmer will raise chickens, collect eggs, and butcher chickens for food. You will have to capture and bring in two chickens to the Chicken Farmer’s Hut, as the Chicken Farmer will not catch and bring in any chickens."
		""
		"The Chicken Farmer will only keep two chickens alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten chickens."
	]
	quest.79A852D2B339DF57.quest_subtitle: "&8Silver Dungeons&r are located within structures resembling a &aparthenon&r in the sky. These have multiple floors, typically three, each with multiple rooms. Most rooms have chests inside them, and while the majority of the chests are fake (&cMimics&r), others contain some items. Silver Dungeons are inhabited by &9Valkyries&r, which only attack when the player attacks them. When playing on Peaceful, Valkyries still appear, but will teleport away when the player tries to attack them. Killing a &9Valkyrie&r yields a single &aVictory Medal&r. The boss of this dungeon can only be attacked by presenting it with &a10 Victory Medals&r, which can be done by right-clicking on it with the &aVictory Medals&r in hand. The &aSilver Dungeon boss&r can be attacked with any weapon."
	quest.79FCBEBFE6E29E44.quest_desc: ["The &6mechinal drill&r is a item that will mine any block infront of it which is really nice for setting up farms that require blocks to be broken, like a cobblestone farm"]
	quest.79FCBEBFE6E29E44.quest_subtitle: "Mines for you"
	quest.7B5E2CD676A1A1C4.quest_desc: ["The Baker will craft bread dough, cookie dough, cake dough, and raw pumpkin pie, then bake these in a furnace to create bread, cookies, cakes, and pumpkin pies. They will only do this upon request, whether from the Cook, the postbox, or as a minimum stock in the Warehouse."]
	quest.7B5E2CD676A1A1C4.quest_subtitle: "Build a Bakery"
	quest.7B72B8A2A801BDBE.quest_desc: ["The &6netherite backpack&r is the upgrade of the &ediamond backpack&r. It has 120 storage slots and can hold 7 upgrades"]
	quest.7B72B8A2A801BDBE.quest_subtitle: "Insane storage on the go"
	quest.7C53E556EF451A95.quest_subtitle: "Allows more filtering of what is or isn't depostited"
	quest.7CB9B1EF0A22B24C.quest_subtitle: "Let your backpack worry about your hunger instead of you"
	quest.7DC9A48B25E63807.quest_desc: ["The &6brass funnel&r is an upgraded andesite funnel, lets you add item filters and moves upto a stack at a time"]
	quest.7DC9A48B25E63807.quest_subtitle: "An upgraded funnel"
	quest.7DEF62FF09935736.title: "Obtain&5 Hammer of Kingbdogz"
	quest.7DFFD1F66AB6296F.title: "Visit crimson forest"
	quest.7E023A9B6A3AEB64.title: "Obtain a &2Host Armour Trim&r"
	quest.7E46F131FF61C0EA.quest_subtitle: "4x Stack Size"
	quest.7E87D79F02B29026.quest_subtitle: "Tame &bSwets"
	quest.7E87D79F02B29026.title: "Obtain &3Swet Cape"
	quest.7ED274FAF6138F13.quest_subtitle: "By itself can cook &e&l6 items&r like a &6&lcampfire&r. You can place a &b&lCooking Pot&r or &6&lSkillet&r on top.&r"
	quest.7EF1D870E752E4DA.quest_desc: [
		"The &6cart assembler&r has the ability to attach any machine you want to build to a minecart, it can also move blocks that aren't able to be moved in regular vanilla like budding ameythyst and spawners"
		""
		"&l&cIf you want to move spawners you need to enable it in the create configs&r&r"
	]
	quest.7EF1D870E752E4DA.quest_subtitle: "Maybe one of the most OP items"
	quest.7F34165C88365C2D.quest_subtitle: "Allows the player to fly for a short period and grants &aimmunity to fall damage&r"
	quest.7F34165C88365C2D.title: "Obtain &7 Valkyrie Cape"
	quest.7F5228C9A9FC87D5.quest_desc: [
		"The &6encased fan&r has many different uses, it can be used to blast, wash, haunt and smoke items. The rotation will mean it either pushes or pulls air"
		""
		"To &cblast&r items you need to put a lava source infront of the fan"
		"To &9wash&r items you need to put a water source infront of the fan"
		"To &bhaunt&r items you need to put a soul campfire infront of the fan"
		"To &esmoke&r items you need to put a campire infront of the fan"
	]
	quest.7F5228C9A9FC87D5.quest_subtitle: "Has multiple uses"
	quest.7F5228C9A9FC87D5.title: "Encased fan"
